@startuml UC08 - Convert Lead to Customer - Sequence Diagram
title UC08 - Convert Lead to Customer - Sequence Diagram

actor "Sales User" as Sales
participant "Next.js" as FE
participant "NestJS API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "RabbitMQ" as MQ

Sales -> FE : 1. Select Convert Lead
FE -> API : 2. POST conversion request
API -> DB : 3. Get Lead
DB --> API : 4. Return Lead
API -> DB : 5. Check existing Customer
DB --> API : 6. Return Customer result

alt Customer not exists
    API -> DB : 7. Create Customer
else Customer exists
    API -> DB : 7. Use existing Customer
end

API -> DB : 8. Link Lead to Customer
API -> DB : 9. Update Lead = CONVERTED
API -> DB : 10. Save Audit Log
API -> MQ : 11. Publish lead.converted
API --> FE : 12. Return Customer

@enduml
